  'landing.art30_explainer': { et: 'DORA Art. 30 sätestab 8 kohustuslikku nõuet, mis peavad sisalduma finantssektori ettevõtete ja IKT-teenusepakkujate vahelistes lepingutes. Mittevastavuse korral võib Finantsinspektsioon määrata trahvi kuni 2% aastasest käibest.', en: 'DORA Art. 30 establishes 8 mandatory requirements that must be included in contracts between financial sector companies and ICT service providers. Non-compliance may result in fines up to 2% of annual turnover by the Financial Supervisory Authority.', fi: 'DORA Art. 30 establishes 8 mandatory requirements that must be included in contracts between financial sector companies and ICT service providers. Non-compliance may result in fines up to 2% of annual turnover by the Financial Supervisory Authority.', lv: 'DORA Art. 30 establishes 8 mandatory requirements that must be included in contracts between financial sector companies and ICT service providers. Non-compliance may result in fines up to 2% of annual turnover by the Financial Supervisory Authority.', lt: 'DORA Art. 30 establishes 8 mandatory requirements that must be included in contracts between financial sector companies and ICT service providers. Non-compliance may result in fines up to 2% of annual turnover by the Financial Supervisory Authority.', pl: 'DORA Art. 30 establishes 8 mandatory requirements that must be included in contracts between financial sector companies and ICT service providers. Non-compliance may result in fines up to 2% of annual turnover by the Financial Supervisory Authority.' },

