  'fine.gap_q1': { et: 'Puuduv ICT riskijuhtimise raamistik suurendab trahviriski oluliselt. DORA Art. 6-16 nõuab kõigilt finantsasutustelt ICT riskide tuvastamist, hindamist ja maandamist.', en: 'Missing ICT risk management framework significantly increases fine risk. DORA Art. 6-16 requires all financial entities to identify, assess and mitigate ICT risks.', fi: 'Missing ICT risk management framework significantly increases fine risk. DORA Art. 6-16 requires all financial entities to identify, assess and mitigate ICT risks.', lv: 'Missing ICT risk management framework significantly increases fine risk. DORA Art. 6-16 requires all financial entities to identify, assess and mitigate ICT risks.', lt: 'Missing ICT risk management framework significantly increases fine risk. DORA Art. 6-16 requires all financial entities to identify, assess and mitigate ICT risks.', pl: 'Missing ICT risk management framework significantly increases fine risk. DORA Art. 6-16 requires all financial entities to identify, assess and mitigate ICT risks.' },
