  'fine.gap_q3': { et: 'DORA Art. 30 nõuetele mittevastavad ICT lepingud on üks sagedasemaid rikkumisi. Lepingud peavad sisaldama konkreetseid teenustaseme kokkuleppeid ja auditeerimisõigusi.', en: 'ICT contracts not complying with DORA Art. 30 is one of the most common violations. Contracts must include specific SLAs and audit rights.', fi: 'ICT contracts not complying with DORA Art. 30 is one of the most common violations. Contracts must include specific SLAs and audit rights.', lv: 'ICT contracts not complying with DORA Art. 30 is one of the most common violations. Contracts must include specific SLAs and audit rights.', lt: 'ICT contracts not complying with DORA Art. 30 is one of the most common violations. Contracts must include specific SLAs and audit rights.', pl: 'ICT contracts not complying with DORA Art. 30 is one of the most common violations. Contracts must include specific SLAs and audit rights.' },
